        "en": "Clients emphasize Gabriel's positive, compassionate approach that focuses on natural boundaries and communication rather than treats or harsh corrections. Reviewers note that reactive, anxious, and stubborn dogs respond quickly to his calm demeanor and thrive in a low-stress setting."
      }
